{# Inner body of a public CMS-driven page — title heading + rendered
   block stream. Used inside StaticPageShell.twig (which adds the
   max-width wrapper) or, for the 404 path, directly inside its own
   ad-hoc wrapper.

   title: page title (variables already substituted upstream)
   blocks_html: pre-rendered block stream HTML (renderBlocksToHtml)
   is_moderator_view: true when the viewer sees moderator-only blocks/pages
   that a regular visitor never would (D-119) — the page itself never said
   so, and staff read that silence as "everyone sees this". #}
{% if is_moderator_view ?? false %}
<div class="text-sm p-2 mb-4 rounded-lg bg-surface-alt border border-default" data-test-id="static-page-moderator-banner">
    Вы видите эту страницу как модератор — часть содержимого скрыта от обычных посетителей.
</div>
{% endif %}
<h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-on-surface mb-6">{{ title }}</h1>
<div class="text-on-surface">{{ blocks_html | raw }}</div>
